  id: franz_joseph_haydn
  category: bandas musicales
  difficulty: 1
  answer: Franz Joseph Haydn
  acceptedAnswers:
  - Franz Joseph Haydn
  hints:
  - "Su cat\xE1logo registrado incluye \xABAndante\xBB, de 1944, y llega hasta 1998."
  - "\xABSymphony No. 94 in G Major, Hob. I:94 \"Surprise\": II. Andante\xBB presenta
    una energ\xEDa suave y un pulso cercano a 98 BPM."
  - "Entre sus grabaciones figuran \xABAdagio in F, H.XVII No.9\xBB y \xABPiano Trio
    in E flat, H.XV No.10: 2. Presto\xBB."
  - "Tambi\xE9n lanz\xF3 \xABString Quartet No. 62 in C Major, Op. 76, No. 3, Hob.III:77,
    \"Emperor\": II. Poco adagio, cantabile\xBB."
  - "Es el proyecto musical detr\xE1s de \xABCello Concerto No. 1 in C Major, Hob.
    VIIb:1: II. Adagio\xBB y \xABCello Concerto No. 1 in C Major, Hob.VIIb:1: III.
    Allegro molto\xBB."
